# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Block palettes
- **Several blocks at once:** *"a palette with prismarine and gold"* puts both of them in the palette
- **Any block works as a start:** ores (*"deepslate lapis ore"*), cactus, flowers, leaves, slabs and more, not just full building blocks. Suggestions are still building blocks
- *"Gold"* means the Block of Gold, not gold ore
- Grass, leaves and water have their real colors

## Better answers about vanilla things
- Real Minecraft words aren't "corrected" anymore: *"how do I craft a minecart?"* no longer turns into *"minecraft"*
- A question that names a vanilla block, item, mob, biome, enchantment or effect (*"how many uses are there for iron ingots?"*) always gets the Minecraft Wiki page about it
